Hi all,

I am quite new to secr and have just started using it for my project looking at leopard densities in the Eastern Cape (South Africa). Apart from a warning message for a small sample size during the closure test, all code appeared to be running fine until I compared all the created secr.fit files for the AIC values which returns the following:

                                   logLik     AIC    AICc dAICc AICcwt
Unbaited30fit_null              -69.66038 145.321 169.321    NA     NA
