Hi
Welcome to the group.
This is a problem specific to AICc with very small sample sizes (when the number of parameters is greater than or equal to the number of individuals). I expect it won't happen if you specify criterion = 'AIC' in the AIC call (and AIC is probably a more reliable criterion in general). In any case, it would seem you have too few data for fancy models, and the likelihood differences are all negligible.
Murray

